                                                "sense_id": "1f051a64-fbc6-367e-b4b3-9e6c88259808",
                                                "text": "Superheating, first introduced with the \"Abs\", stopped further development in compounding, in New Zealand as elsewhere, and the \"Abs\" succeeded in dealing with the growing traffic unaided for more than a decade."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
